1. Clone the repository
2. Install Go 1.25.0 or later and GCC (SQLite requires CGO)
3. Install binaries to $GOPATH/bin

    env CGO_ENABLED=1 go install -tags "oss nolimit" github.com/drone/drone/cmd/drone-server

   Build on RHEL 8 / UBI 8 when deploying to RHEL 8, so the binary
   links against glibc 2.28. See docs/lsf-runner.md for details.

4. Start the server at localhost:8080

    export DRONE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=...
    export DRONE_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=...
    drone-server
